{"title":"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser_(STRAIGHTFORWARD_AND_SIMPLE!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by cutoffchaser (STRAIGHTFORWARD AND SIMPLE!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For every dollar Ben spent on bagels, David spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cents less. Ben paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/e/25ebe155234384607a9fcdd394c24d01fc95e966.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$12.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> more than David. How much did they spend in the bagel store together?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/f/6afae1ed4d9336c250a3e3ca857f7ca0a31552a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\$37.50 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$50.00\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$87.50\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$90.00\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\$92.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"555\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If Ben paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/1/a11bf142d85629208372525554361f78fd46140a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 12.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> more than David, then he paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3ead4b27011e0c8526e155c2636244f5eea968a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12.5}{.25}= \\$ 50.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"110\" height=\"37\" />. Thus, David paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/f/07f3cad855f3a0dfbd937023ff9b03dd09964d2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 37.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, and they spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/7/bf7a1ad646ff3f90b2bed51dfb487bdc3e5e4dd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50.00+37.50 =\\$ 87.50 \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }\\$ 87.50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"326\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If for every dollar Ben spent on bagels David spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cents less, then the ratio of the money that Ben spent to David spent is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/def7726c2babb527f7ab2ae4c436cc012ebbd351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4:3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"13\" />. We know that Ben paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/e/25ebe155234384607a9fcdd394c24d01fc95e966.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$12.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> more than David, so we can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/6998ae2d8f3fa781fa38156fcb6d7ef7530c8d93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$12.50\\cdot (4+3)=\\$ 87.50.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"200\" height=\"20\" /> Then the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee90f076869827dbb3b46ebe83c1a7399f1182dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~@azure123456\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/huMBaF16tlM\">https://youtu.be/huMBaF16tlM</a>\n</pre>\n<p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VIt6LnkV4_w?t=81\">https://youtu.be/VIt6LnkV4_w?t=81</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tYU8ZZKar4A\">https://youtu.be/tYU8ZZKar4A</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser_.28STRAIGHTFORWARD_AND_SIMPLE.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser_(STRAIGHTFORWARD_AND_SIMPLE!)\">Video Solution by cutoffchaser (STRAIGHTFORWARD AND SIMPLE!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by cutoffchaser (STRAIGHTFORWARD AND SIMPLE!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I0uTtGZnRBk\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I0uTtGZnRBk</a>\n</p><p>~piHard\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span>